  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">De-Risking Mining Investment Research (Phase 1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global demand for critical minerals is accelerating due to the energy transition and digitalisation. There is a need for market-based mechanisms that can stimulate private sector investment, incorporate risk-sharing strategies, and attract multilateral finance&#x2014;without distorting market dynamics. The first phase of this research will be an initial scoping of market mechanism options that could be used to de-risk and incentivise long-term investment in mineral mining in higher-risk regions.</narrative>
  </description>
